{
  "name": "Follow up personally when an invoice is viewed but unpaid after 3 days (ASHDOCS + Gmail)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "events": [
          "invoice.viewed"
        ],
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "60028e1a-68ce-4ff3-a191-30ecaf3541a8",
      "name": "Invoice viewed",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-ashdocs.ashdocsTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "webhookId": "09f46f64-29d6-45aa-a50d-8f2ffdf8e1a2",
      "credentials": {
        "ashdocsApi": {
          "name": "ASHDOCS API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "fd9819c4-1e61-4d6d-a8fd-8517cc4c410c",
              "name": "yourName",
              "value": "Your name",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "includeOtherFields": true,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "bd946a86-02ff-4557-a0e0-664123f52757",
      "name": "Settings",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        240,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "amount": 3,
        "unit": "days"
      },
      "id": "eddfdea9-f765-4603-afe0-8cc1fbafbdef",
      "name": "Wait 3 days",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.wait",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        480,
        0
      ],
      "webhookId": "a1a2d71b-1eed-4949-a347-54f999c78918"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "invoice",
        "operation": "get",
        "getBy": "id",
        "invoiceId": "={{ $('Settings').item.json.id }}",
        "simplify": false
      },
      "id": "4271341c-3f36-47eb-ae56-12d3d0338678",
      "name": "Get invoice",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-ashdocs.ashdocs",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        720,
        0
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 2000,
      "credentials": {
        "ashdocsApi": {
          "name": "ASHDOCS API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "4d517531-1f9c-4b07-a647-2f37fa81a512",
              "leftValue": "={{ !['paid', 'void'].includes($json.status) && Number($json.totals?.balance_minor ?? 0) > 0 }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "a6ec1d1d-8881-44f1-aac6-fff247f7ed31",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.customer?.email }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "looseTypeValidation": true,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "39ad5b13-ac2e-49e3-a4fb-8c957c908c9e",
      "name": "Still unpaid?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        960,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "sendTo": "={{ $json.customer.email }}",
        "subject": "=Invoice {{ $json.number }}",
        "emailType": "text",
        "message": "=Hi {{ $json.customer.name || 'there' }},\n\nJust checking in on invoice {{ $json.number }} for {{ $json.totals.balance_formatted }}. Did you have any questions about it? Happy to help if anything is unclear.\n\nHere is the link again in case it is useful: {{ $json.pay_link_url || $json.hosted_url }}\n\nThanks,\n{{ $('Settings').first().json.yourName }}",
        "options": {
          "appendAttribution": false
        }
      },
      "id": "dd600162-371c-43e9-a541-eb2d79df93b1",
      "name": "Personal follow-up",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        1200,
        -100
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "gmailOAuth2": {
          "name": "Gmail account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "3985c315-e7eb-415e-ace0-197d6b4ff42f",
      "name": "Already paid",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1200,
        140
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "**Self-hosted n8n only:** this version uses the community node `n8n-nodes-ashdocs` (n8n verification pending), so it runs on self-hosted n8n. The HTTP version of the same template uses only built-in nodes and also runs on n8n Cloud.\n\n\n## Follow up personally when an invoice is viewed but unpaid after 3 days (ASHDOCS + Gmail)\n\nFreelancers and account managers who would rather send a short, personal check-in than another automated reminder when a client has looked at an invoice but not paid.\n\n### How it works\n1. ASHDOCS reports the first time the client opens the invoice page (`invoice.viewed` fires once per invoice).\n2. The workflow waits three days.\n3. **Get invoice** reads the invoice again. If it is still unpaid (not paid or void, with a balance left), Gmail sends a short note from you with the pay link; otherwise the run ends.\n\n### Requirements\n- An ASHDOCS account (https://www.ashdocs.com/?utm_source=n8n&utm_medium=template&utm_campaign=viewed-not-paid). Needs a paid ASHDOCS plan (Starter and up): the invoice events (sent, viewed, paid, overdue) are delivered by webhooks, which the Free plan does not include.\n- A Gmail account\n- Self-hosted n8n with the community node `n8n-nodes-ashdocs` installed\n\n[ASHDOCS](https://www.ashdocs.com/?utm_source=n8n&utm_medium=template&utm_campaign=viewed-not-paid) · [Docs](https://www.ashdocs.com/docs)",
        "height": 640,
        "width": 540,
        "color": 1
      },
      "id": "a0d214f6-4066-4458-ace5-b7fa31ada560",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -1160,
        -300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Setup\n**Plan:** Needs a paid ASHDOCS plan (Starter and up): the invoice events (sent, viewed, paid, overdue) are delivered by webhooks, which the Free plan does not include.\n\n1. Create an ASHDOCS account at https://www.ashdocs.com/?utm_source=n8n&utm_medium=template&utm_campaign=viewed-not-paid and create an API key on the **API Keys** page of the dashboard. A test key makes watermarked test invoices while you try the workflow.\n2. Install the ASHDOCS community node: **Settings → Community nodes → Install**, enter `n8n-nodes-ashdocs`. Then open any ASHDOCS node and create the **ASHDOCS API** credential with your key.\n3. Connect Gmail in **Personal follow-up**.\n4. Put your name in **Settings**.\n5. Activate the workflow. The **ASHDOCS Trigger** registers its own signed webhook for `invoice.viewed` in your ASHDOCS account, and removes it when you deactivate the workflow.\n6. The **Wait** node keeps the execution in n8n’s database for three days. That needs an n8n that keeps running with a persistent database (n8n Cloud, or self-hosted with a database volume). A container that loses its data on restart loses waiting executions.",
        "height": 480,
        "width": 480,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "17c9896e-5fb2-44e2-aca9-12237001a8f5",
      "name": "Setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -580,
        -300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Customize\n- Change the wait in **Wait 3 days**.\n- Rewrite the note in **Personal follow-up**; keep it short, it is meant to read like you typed it.\n- Notify yourself on Slack instead of emailing the client.",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 480,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "38f32921-c194-448d-aca0-e5510d4830f4",
      "name": "Customize",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -580,
        220
      ]
    }
  ],
